&lt;li class="MsoNormal" style="color: black; font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;On May 8, 2026, following the retirement of Karen S. Haller, Chief Executive Officer of the general partner entity, Southwest Gas Corporation, Justin L. Brown assumed the role of President and Chief Executive Officer of the entity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="MsoNormal" style="color: black; font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;not applicable&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
