  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag8" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="Normal1"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16.0pt; color: black;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;In the second quarter of 2026, there were $21,254 non-cash investing activities related to construction activities expended by the general partner, SWG, on behalf of the Company. This activity typically is reflected in the Company&amp;#8217;s plant-related accounts, as well as in Accounts Payable to Associated Companies, but has no direct impact on cash flows.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
